# Accepted vulnerability findings. One CVE per line, with the reason and an
# expiry so entries do not become permanent by accident.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-2024-12345 exp:2026-12-31
#
# Rules for this repo:
# - only add an entry when the CVE is unreachable from how the code is used,
#   or when no fixed version exists and the risk is accepted in writing
# - always set an expiry, six months maximum
# - never suppress a finding in the receiver's request path without a note
